  abstract      = {We demonstrate a calibration-free 2\texttimes{}2 Mach-Zehnder switch (MZS) and a 4\texttimes{}4 MZS array that integrates thermally actuated phase shifters with oppositely connected diodes on each arm, enabling bidirectional thermo-optic control via polarity-switched voltage inputs.},
  keywords      = {Phased arrays;Optical losses;PIN photodiodes;Phase shifters;Photonic integrated circuits;Switches;Silicon photonics;Topology;Voltage control;Switching circuits;Mach-Zehnder switch;calibration-free;silicon photonics;CMOS electronics;monolithic integration}
