  abstract      = {Some of the significant factors that need to be considered to achieve optimum efficiency from process machinery are discussed. Paper manufacturers are suffering from rising fuel cost and increasing pressure to reduce emissions and carbon footprint. Spooner in association with Voith Paper and the HPC\texttrademark{} Dryer has developed a highly efficient dryer the ModuleDryer\texttrademark{}. It provides shorter machine, superior web stability, reduced downtime, and significant energy saving. The dryer integrates high evaporation rates with excellent web handling to allow simultaneous turning and drying or cooling of the web. It also has a nozzle system and various energy saving and heat recovery system to reduce energy consumption. Spooner also offers various services including process inspections, audits, refurbishment, relocation, upgrades, maintenance schedules, training, and bespoke spare parts to keep machine running with optimum efficiency.},
