  note          = {Cited by: 0},
  abstract      = {Space supercomputing refers to supercomputing systems deployed in extraterrestrial space,capable of scientific computing,intelligent computing,and big data processing. With the advent of the post-Moore's Law era,the rapid development of energy technology and aerospace technology,and the urgent need for human space migration,space supercomputing is poised to become a strtegic high ground in future technological development. As a new concept product,space supercomputing faces challenges in aspects such as system architecture technology,megawatt-level space power generation and energy storage technology,heat dissipation technology,communication technology,reliability technology,operation and maintenance technology,reusable launch vehicle technology,low-cost technology,and sustainable operation. Space supercomputing plays an important application value in supporting space numerical calculations and the operation of space bases,while driving the development of space-based power utilization,reusable launch vehicles,and space information technology. It is expected that an investment of the order of several billion yuan can be used to build a P-level space supercomputing verification system within five years；and industrialized operation will be formed in about 30 years. Humanity will enter the space information era from the era of satellites and space stations,and the development and utilization of space will reach a new level. \textcopyright{} 2025, Chinese Society of Astronautics. All rights reserved.},
