  keywords      = {Abrasives; Alumina; Aluminum coated steel; Aluminum coatings; Aluminum metallography; Aluminum nitride; Aluminum oxide; Boron carbide; Calcium fluoride; Carbide cutting tools; Carbon nitride; Chromium compounds; Chromium metallography; Cobalt compounds; Cobalt metallography; Computerized tomography; Cubic boron nitride; Diffusion in liquids; Electric discharge machining; Electric discharges; Electrochemical cutting; Fluids; Fluorine compounds; Fluorspar; Global warming; High speed steel; III-V semiconductors; Iron and steel industry; Iron and steel plants; Iron metallography; Layered semiconductors; Machinability; Marine applications; Metal cutting; Metal working; Molybdenum compounds; Molybdenum metallography; Occupational risks; Physical vapor deposition; Scanning electron microscopy; Silicon carbide; Silicon nitride; Solid lubricants; Steel powder metallurgy; Sulfur compounds; Superalloys; Textures; Thermal management (electronics); Tin metallography; Tin oxides; Titanium carbide; Titanium metallography; Titanium nitride; Titanium oxides; Tungsten carbide; Tungsten metallography; Ultrasonic cutting; Wear of materials; American iron and steel institutes; Electron back scatter diffraction; International organization for standardizations; Minimum quantity lubrication; National Institute of Occupational Safety and Health; Polycrystalline cubic boron nitride; Titanium aluminium nitride; Wire electrical discharge machining; Cutting tools},
